-- =============================================================================
-- City-level (DESTINATION) route coverage vs POI proximity   [WHOLE QUERY]
-- "Out of the Top 1000 SD routes serving each destination city, how many
--  route_ids have a dropping point within 1 km / within 3 km of that city's POI"
